   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>I don&#39;t know if I am just doing this wrong, or I am trying to do something I should not be able to do.</div><div><br></div><div>The goal is to use a reactive, such as input_select, to specify the variable to use for the y-axis.</div><div><br></div><div>Any insights or guidance much appreciated!</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div><br></div><div>Ian</div><div><br></div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">library(ggvis)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">set.seed(3.14)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">n_points &lt;- 100</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">x &lt;- runif(n_points, min = -10, max = 10)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">y1 &lt;- 3 * x + 5 + rnorm(n_points, mean = 0, sd = 4)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">y2 &lt;- -2 * x - 4 + rnorm(n_points, mean = 0, sd = 4)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">df &lt;- data.frame(x, y1, y2)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># works!</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">df %&gt;% </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  ggvis(x = ~x, y = <a href=\"http://as.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://as.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484961056000&amp;usg=AOvVaw031khikhw5BJbqlJ1zrydv\">as.name</a>(&quot;y2&quot;)) %&gt;%</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  layer_points()</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">choices &lt;- c(&quot;y1&quot;, &quot;y2&quot;)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">choices_name &lt;- c(y1 = <a href=\"http://as.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://as.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484961056000&amp;usg=AOvVaw031khikhw5BJbqlJ1zrydv\">as.name</a>(&quot;y1&quot;), y2 = <a href=\"http://as.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://as.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484961056000&amp;usg=AOvVaw031khikhw5BJbqlJ1zrydv\">as.name</a>(&quot;y2&quot;))</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># what is the right way to get this to work?</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># error</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">df %&gt;% </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  ggvis(x = ~x, y = <a href=\"http://as.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://as.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484961056000&amp;usg=AOvVaw031khikhw5BJbqlJ1zrydv\">as.name</a>(input_select(choices))) %&gt;%</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  layer_points()</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># error</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">df %&gt;% </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  ggvis(x = ~x, y = input_select(<a href=\"http://as.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://as.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484961056000&amp;usg=AOvVaw031khikhw5BJbqlJ1zrydv\">as.name</a>(choices))) %&gt;%</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  layer_points()</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># error</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">df %&gt;% </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  ggvis(x = ~x, y = input_select(choices_name)) %&gt;%</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  layer_points()</font></div></div></div>"
