     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I&#39;ve been twiddling with this some more - here&#39;s an example of how to get most of this to work using shiny explicitly:</div><div><br></div><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msg/ggvis/81VUkFVNkRw/t9PENns1xEMJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msg/ggvis/81VUkFVNkRw/t9PENns1xEMJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484961058000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Bn8dQUyzVrsYTutJvV7FP\">https://groups.google.com/d/msg/ggvis/81VUkFVNkRw/t9PENns1xEMJ</a><div><br></div><div>It remains to be able to label the axis, which has already been shown to be a Vega issue (I think)</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msg/ggvis/ZJXdIFAmb68/bOp_PEi8aZgJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msg/ggvis/ZJXdIFAmb68/bOp_PEi8aZgJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484961058000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0tW_4y5SkVx-zZwC-5m8UJ\">https://groups.google.com/d/msg/ggvis/ZJXdIFAmb68/bOp_PEi8aZgJ</a></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
