     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Yes, it&#39;s not possible to have a ggvis plot draw from another column, without sending a new spec. But you can change data in response to the inputs, as you did in your example.<div><br></div><div>-Winston</div>\r\n\r\n</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
