    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I&#39;ve been twiddling with this some more - here&#39;s an example of how to get most of this to work using shiny explicitly:</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msg/ggvis/81VUkFVNkRw/t9PENns1xEMJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msg/ggvis/81VUkFVNkRw/t9PENns1xEMJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484961060000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Z4eowyDOTvLilg_mmLi40\">https://groups.google.com/d/msg/ggvis/81VUkFVNkRw/t9PENns1xEMJ</a><div><br></div><div>It remains to be able to label the axis, which has already been shown to be a Vega issue (I think)</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msg/ggvis/ZJXdIFAmb68/bOp_PEi8aZgJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msg/ggvis/ZJXdIFAmb68/bOp_PEi8aZgJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484961060000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1BOXPmlfhB5Jms1mIOKucS\">https://groups.google.com/d/msg/ggvis/ZJXdIFAmb68/bOp_PEi8aZgJ</a></div><div><div><div><br></div><div>\r\n\r\n<br>On Friday, July 4, 2014 10:50:53 AM UTC-5, Ian Lyttle wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>I don&#39;t know if I am just doing this wrong, or I am trying to do something I should not be able to do.</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div>The goal is to use a reactive, such as input_select, to specify the variable to use for the y-axis.</div><div><br></div><div>Any insights or guidance much appreciated!</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div>Ian</div><div><br></div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">library(ggvis)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">set.seed(3.14)</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">n_points &lt;- 100</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">x &lt;- runif(n_points, min = -10, max = 10)</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">y1 &lt;- 3 * x + 5 + rnorm(n_points, mean = 0, sd = 4)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">y2 &lt;- -2 * x - 4 + rnorm(n_points, mean = 0, sd = 4)</font></div><div>\r\n\r\n<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">df &lt;- data.frame(x, y1, y2)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># works!</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">df %&gt;% </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  ggvis(x = ~x, y = <a href=\"http://as.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://as.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484961060000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cDID0diy6D7blfGNI_ZYS\">as.name</a>(&quot;y2&quot;)) %&gt;%</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  layer_points()</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">choices &lt;- c(&quot;y1&quot;, &quot;y2&quot;)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">choices_name &lt;- c(y1 = <a href=\"http://as.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://as.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484961060000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cDID0diy6D7blfGNI_ZYS\">as.name</a>(&quot;y1&quot;), y2 = <a href=\"http://as.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://as.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484961060000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cDID0diy6D7blfGNI_ZYS\">as.name</a>(&quot;y2&quot;))</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># what is the right way to get this to work?</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># error</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">df %&gt;% </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  ggvis(x = ~x, y = <a href=\"http://as.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://as.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484961060000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cDID0diy6D7blfGNI_ZYS\">as.name</a>(input_select(choices))<u></u>) %&gt;%</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  layer_points()</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># error</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">df %&gt;% </font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  ggvis(x = ~x, y = input_select(<a href=\"http://as.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://as.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484961060000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cDID0diy6D7blfGNI_ZYS\">as.name</a>(choices))<u></u>) %&gt;%</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  layer_points()</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># error</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">df %&gt;% </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  ggvis(x = ~x, y = input_select(choices_name)) %&gt;%</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  layer_points()</font></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
